class.description:
A node that captures the primary display in real-time using native OS APIs and exposes it as an [ImageTexture].
[b]Basic usage:[/b]
[codeblock]
@onready var caster: DesktopCaster = $DesktopCaster
@onready var rect: TextureRect = $TextureRect

func _ready():
    if caster.start():
        rect.texture = caster.get_texture()
[/codeblock]
[b]Platform support:[/b] Windows (DXGI Desktop Duplication), Linux (PipeWire/XDG Portal with X11 fallback), macOS (planned).
